senses.gloss:
पुर (रं-री)
n. f. A town or city. 1.
m. A sort of resin, bdellium;
yellow barleria.
f. (रा) The east;
a perfume.
n. A house; body;
calyx; skin; a grass.

पुरस्का_र (रः) 1.
m. Making first or
complete or ready; honouring;
sprinkling holy water; promise;
attack; anticipating; reward.

पुर-स्कृत (तः-ता-तं)
a. Placed first,
made perfect or ready; revered;
initiated; promised; accused;
distressed; anticipated.

पुरा_र्द्ध-विस्तर (रः) 1.
m. Part of a town;
a suburb; ward; division.

पुरो-ग (गः-गा-गं)
a. Going before;
chief, pre-eminent.

पूर्व्व-पक्ष (क्षः) 1.
m. A proposition;
1st half of a lunar month.

पूर्व्वा_भ्यास (सः) 1.
m. Former practice;
experience; first lesson.
